\fs36 The Presentation\fs24\par
 \par
\par
\i\fs20 The bishop and people sit. A Priest and a Lay Person, and additional\par
presenters if desired, standing before the bishop, present the ordinand,\par
saying\i0\fs24\par
 \par
\i N\i0 ., Bishop in the Church of God, on behalf of the clergy and people of the Diocese of \i N\i0 ., we present to you \i N.N\i0 . to be ordained a priest in Christ's holy catholic Church.\par
 \par
\i\fs20 Bishop\i0\fs24\par
\pard\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720  \par
\pard\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 Has \i he\i0  been selected in accordance with the canons of this\par
Church? And do you believe his manner of life to be suitable \par
to the exercise of this ministry? \par
 \par
\i\fs20 Presenters\i0\fs24\par
\pard\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720  \par
