Christ as this Church has received them? And will you, in\par
accordance with the canons of this Church, obey your bishop and other ministers who may have authority over you and \par
your work? \par
 \par
\i\fs20 Answer\i0\fs24\par
\pard\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx342\tx1062\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720  \par
